femto patch for quireink-stardict 0.3.0
Subject: depend on miniz_oxide 0.9.1

Move the miniz_oxide dependency (and dev-dependency) from 0.8 to 0.9.1. No
source change is needed.

femto patches miniz_oxide 0.9.1 (heap-allocated inflate state) and wants a
single inflater version in the firmware.

The diff is against the normalised Cargo.toml in the published crate. The
upstream workspace manifest (crates/quireink-stardict/Cargo.toml, kept in the
archive as Cargo.toml.orig) needs the same edit; Cargo.toml.orig is not
touched here, matching the vendored tree.

--- a/Cargo.toml
+++ b/Cargo.toml
@@ -53,7 +53,7 @@
 path = "tests/real.rs"
 
 [dependencies.miniz_oxide]
-version = "0.8"
+version = "0.9.1"
 features = ["with-alloc"]
 default-features = false
 
@@ -61,7 +61,7 @@
 version = "0.3.0"
 
 [dev-dependencies.miniz_oxide]
-version = "0.8"
+version = "0.9.1"
 features = ["with-alloc"]
 
 [dev-dependencies.quireink-fs]
